// Pseudocode. <Element> denotes a type parameter; its declaration syntax and
// constraint are still open. @collection supplies Array's storage members and
// operations; support is pending.

@collection
construct Array<Element> {}

// Proposed Array behavior: elements are ordered, and filtering preserves that
// order. The resulting collection is another Array<Element>.
// Array has no written members: its value is the members @collection emits.
